            "title": "Trump's Iran threat boosts oil; JPM, BofA give to Trump accounts",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance Senior Producer <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/john-hyland/\" data-i13n=\"slk:John Hyland;cpos:1;pos:1\">John Hyland</a> tracks Wednesday's <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/trending/\" data-i13n=\"slk:top moving stocks;cpos:2;pos:1\">top moving stocks</a> and biggest market stories in this<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\" data-i13n=\"slk: Market Minute;cpos:3;pos:1\"> Market Minute</a>.</p><p>Oil (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CL=F/\" data-i13n=\"slk:CL=F;cpos:4;pos:1\">CL=F</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BZ=F/\" data-i13n=\"slk:BZ=F;cpos:5;pos:1\">BZ=F</a>) is trading at a four-month high after President Trump threatened an attack on Iran.</p><p>Bank of America (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BAC/\" data-i13n=\"slk:BAC;cpos:6;pos:1\">BAC</a>) and JPMorgan (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/JPM/\" data-i13n=\"slk:JPM;cpos:7;pos:1\">JPM</a>) announced they will be matching the US Treasury's $1,000 contribution to each \"Trump account.\"</p><p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\" data-i13n=\"slk:Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.;cpos:8;pos:1\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
